---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Testimonials">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-32 pb-16">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600 tracking-wide uppercase eyebrow mb-2">Social proof</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl mb-6">
        Don't take my word for it&hellip;
      </h1>
      <p class="lede text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Take it from the people I've been building stuff with over the years&hellip;
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12">
      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-slate-700 italic mb-6">
          <p>&ldquo;It was a great pleasure working with Gareth during our time together at LIV Golf. He is an excellent writer and editor with an exceptional understanding of journalism and multimedia production, but more than that, he is an incredible team player with a tremendous work ethic, always stepping up to help the team in any way possible, including with tasks that would typically fall outside his role.&rdquo;</p>
          <p>&ldquo;Gareth's ability to leverage his unique skill set helped build the LIV Golf League from the ground up, and the website and online brand would not be what it is today without his contributions. Any company would be lucky to have him.&rdquo;</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Jason Crook</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Senior Digital Writer, LIV Golf</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-slate-700 italic mb-6">
          <p>&ldquo;Gareth is a top professional with a thorough understanding of the media industry. He is a very efficient multi skilled journalist with more than a decade experience in the industry.&rdquo;</p>
          <p>&ldquo;For the last year he was a regular guest in my radio show, always contributing with interesting stories about Premier League. His command of Spanish vocabulary is so good that it makes me feel bad with myself!&rdquo;</p>
          <p>&ldquo;I would certainly recommend Gareth. He will be a tremendous asset for any media company.&rdquo;</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">&Aacute;lvaro Romeo</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Editor, talkSPORT International</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-slate-700 italic mb-6">
          <p>&ldquo;Working with Gareth was a superb experience. He's very bright, intelligent, quick, witty and an excellent galvaniser of talent. As a real self-starter, he can analyse any news story, find a real unique angle for it and put it out there with great efficiency in no time. Also his multilingual skills are excellent&hellip; even though he wouldn't say so, but I can.&rdquo;</p>
          <p>&ldquo;Last but not least, apart from being a great team leader, he's also a great team player. Either working side by side or cracking jokes in the pub, he's top every time and I wish him all the success he so well deserves.&rdquo;</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Asier Jon</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Designer, Newsweek Media</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Ready to be the next success story?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8">Let's talk about what you're trying to achieve — no obligation, just a free discovery call.</p>
      <a href="mailto:contact@invincibleink.com" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 border border-transparent rounded-md shadow-sm text-lg font-medium text-white bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700">
        Get in touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
